WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.230
If you want to hear how Crypt series such
as Look-See, Troubled Youth, Stoneheart and

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:09.120
Mordeo are all about to collide, then stick
around to the end of this video.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.060
[Intro]

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.420
Hello, and welcome to Horror History, I’m
your teacher: Emo Abraham Lincoln.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.160
In today’s lesson we’ve got a lot to cover,
as we’ll be going over the entire timeline

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.859
of events in the Crypt TV Monster Universe.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:28.130
Mordeo, Look-See, Sunny Family Cult and so
much more are apart of this history and we’ve

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.949
got over 400 years of lore to discuss.

00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:32.880
This lesson is sponsored by Crypt TV.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.180
The earliest known event takes place in 1609,
when Elkridge Falls is established.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.920
This is where the events of Mordeo would later
take place.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.670
In the late 1600s the cursed statue seen in
Stoneheart is created in New England during

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.120
the witch trial era.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.829
"She came from up in New England somewhere.

00:00:53.829 --> 00:00:57.230
Some witch trial protector of women nonsense."

00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:02.500
In 1848, Avon Manor school is established
in the UK and would serve as the setting for

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.150
Shelley nearly 200 years later.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:09.091
Back in the United States though, two more
towns are established, one in Mohawk, New

00:01:09.091 --> 00:01:15.770
York in 1853, and one southeast farming town
known as Harbor in 1876, which would later

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:20.610
be terrorized by Crypt monsters like Look-See,
Aponi, Walter and Fluffy.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:25.180
About 50 years later, The Great Economic Depression
hits the United States, and on March 20th,

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:30.940
1930 in New York City, a banker named Robert
Capshaw kills his entire family upon the closure

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.310
of the bank created by him and his brother.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:37.720
The brother, James Capshaw is forced to leave
New York two years later due to the financial

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.081
situation and the death of his youngest son
and he moves his family out to Harbor, which

00:01:42.081 --> 00:01:44.600
only consists of some farmhouses at the time.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:48.590
He starts getting foreclosure notices at the
barn, and since he is unable to let go of

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:53.180
his emotional attachment to his old bank,
Look-See goes after him, however, a gang of

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:58.270
thieves led by eventual YouTuber James Janisse,
shows up at the same time and gets to him

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.960
first, and Look-See takes one of them out
as a warning not to get in the way.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.250
One by one, Look-See takes out the thieves
and the rest of Capshaw’s family, each having

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.509
some kind of emotional attachment that they
are unable to release.

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:13.489
Only two survivors are left, the cold-hearted
leader of the thieves and the young daughter,

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:17.540
who assists Look-See in completing a ritual
to awaken a second Look-See monster.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:21.079
I wouldn’t be surprised if the two Look-Sees
started their own twin-themed YouTube channel,

00:02:21.079 --> 00:02:23.260
cause that’s the popular thing right now
isn’t it?

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.959
Nearly another 50 years go by before the events
of Mordeo in 1979.

00:02:27.959 --> 00:02:31.720
It starts with a man who is turned into the
Mordeo for eating flesh in the woods.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:35.609
What would follow is the first sighting of
a spellbook known as the Crypt Tome.

00:02:35.609 --> 00:02:39.500
A man known as The Butcher is in possession
of the Tome and attempts to summon Mordeo

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.650
by cutting off another man’s finger and
eating the flesh on the summoning ground.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:47.830
He wants to be changed into a monster, but
the Queen Mordeo kills him, because the flesh

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.209
he ate was not eaten out of desperation.

00:02:50.209 --> 00:02:54.750
Meanwhile, a newspaper headline from Mohawk
tells of a continued search for the missing

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:58.560
girl scouts, so Mohawk and Elkridge must be
somewhat close to each other.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:02.819
The girls stumble across the resurrection
grounds and the Crypt Tome, but the Mordeo

00:03:02.819 --> 00:03:06.930
Queen kills one of the girls, causing the
remaining two get into a fight.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:11.209
One girl bites the other as a form of desperate
self-defense and the other girl slips and

00:03:11.209 --> 00:03:12.560
hits her head on a rock.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:17.519
She brings the Tome to a desolate cabin, where
she says she belongs to the Mordeo and starts

00:03:17.519 --> 00:03:18.560
to transform.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:22.510
When the transformation is complete, she kills
off an injured man, whose girlfriend takes

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.349
the book to try to lead her out of the woods
to escape.

00:03:25.349 --> 00:03:30.010
The next morning, she’s surrounded by several
Mordeo, and although she is able to make it

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:34.840
to the road, she’s unable to escape their
wrath, where the Tome is once again dropped.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.790
YouTuber Bobby Burns, who apparently was a
part of the Sunny Family Cult in the 70s and

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:42.520
80s finds the book, which leads us to era
of the cult’s possession of the book.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:52.310
The cult emerges into the mainstream a couple
years after finding the book in 1982, the

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:56.220
year a man peeing on the side of the road
is killed by two cult members on April Fools

00:03:56.220 --> 00:04:00.920
Day and a crooked lawyer is stabbed many times
and dumped in a lake, where the calling card

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.489
of Sunny Family Cult is found.

00:04:02.489 --> 00:04:08.290
The cult gains so much notoriety that in 1994,
two men named Elias and Roger attempt to start

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.610
up their own chapter of the Sunny Family Cult.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.510
They capture a scam artist who corrupted one
of their members and stab him to death.

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:18.630
Elias and Rodger create their masks as they
begin recruiting new people in an isolated

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.090
location in the western United States.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:26.220
Roger becomes obsessed with the Crypt Tome,
inspired by the legends of Soot, The Birch,

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.620
Aponi, Look-See and Mordeo.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:32.600
He reads the prophecy… that a girl of seventeen
with violence etched into her soul… at the

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:37.170
moment of her greatest weakness… a blood
sacrifice of four victims and the fifth will

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.170
become something.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.480
He has a vision of the girl, who tells him
to “find her.”

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:45.980
Disagreements arise between Elias and Roger
on the values of the cult-- with Roger wanting

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:50.320
to kill everyone involved in a corrupt system,
and Elias only interested snuffing out the

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.940
sources of the corruption.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:55.250
Elias and Roger battle for control of the
cult, and Elias wins.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:05:00.910
Roger backs down and continues to hang around
the cult for another year until May 19th 1995

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:05.640
when Roger attacks someone that Elias refuses
to kill, and they ultimately go their separate

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:06.640
ways.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:10.870
The next tick on the Crypt Timeline takes
place a couple years later across the pond

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:15.630
at Acton Manor, the brother school of Avon
Manor, where a girl named Shelley Carter meets

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:19.220
with her boyfriend, Oliver Greenwood at the
border between the two schools.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:23.700
He gives her a bracelet, one of his final
gestures to her before being burned alive

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.530
in some kind of chemical store room during
science class.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:30.890
His teacher looked the other way, tired of
Oliver’s constant misbehaviour in class.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:34.870
The headmistress covers up the accident, not
wanting the school to get bad press.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.860
When Shelley realizes her boyfriend is missing,
she begins to snoop around the school for

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.860
clues.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.210
Realizing this, the headmistress takes action
to ensure Shelley does not find anything she

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.970
shouldn’t by hiring another student, Heidi,
a girl who already dislikes Shelley, to dispose

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:49.970
of her.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:58.100
"If you squish this bug for us, we can guarantee
there'll be a place waiting for you at Willowdale

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.100
Elite..."

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.760
High school would have been so much more interesting
if there were bounties of every student.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.000
Oh wait, I'm a teacher now, I'm not supposed
to say that.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:10.350
The following year, on graduation day in June
1998, Shelley is strangled by Heidi and two

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.560
other classmates.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:16.130
She watches helplessly as her classmate Celine,
is too afraid to stand up to the bullies and

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.930
Shelley meets her demise.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:23.360
The incident is staged as a suicide, and they
hang Shelley’s body on stage during graduation.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:30.420
After parting ways with Roger and strengthening
his own chapter of the Sunny Family Cult,

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:34.420
Elias got married and moved to a small Iowa
town known as Bettendorf.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:37.990
Around the time of the new millenium, they
gave birth to their first and only daughter

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.150
and named her Taylor.

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:43.270
They kept their lives as cult leaders a secret
from their daughter for as long as they could,

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.900
about six years, before she snuck downstairs
and witnessed one of the rituals.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.740
Apparently they had not heard of baby monitors.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.920
Her parents tell her to keep the rituals a
secret, but Taylor becomes more and more interested

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.310
in the activities of the cult over the years.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:00.740
As this gradually happened while Taylor continued
to grow up, an incident occured in the small

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.720
New York town of Mohawk.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:08.740
In the year 2007, in a certain house, a Mohawk
man beats up on his wife, before going outside

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:09.740
to have a smoke.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.611
He hears a girl’s laughter in the distance,
and after being out there for some time, his

00:07:13.611 --> 00:07:17.320
wife comes out to check on him and discovers
his decapitated head.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:21.640
It’s another five years or so before the
next interesting development with Elias’s

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.640
daughter Taylor.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:26.660
The cult discovers that a copypat member of
their cult has killed a child in town.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:30.700
This marks the first time that Taylor has
attempted to take an active part in the operations

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.790
of the cult.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:36.280
Against her parents wishes, she sets out to
expose the copycat, putting herself in danger

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:40.210
before eventually being rescued by the cult
and facing her father’s fury.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.740
"I'm gonna tell you this one time and you
are gonna listen.

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.280
You don't ever, ever do that again.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.550
This whole thing, everything that we have
and are, it's me.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:59.480
You don't change the plan, you don't say a
word, unless I tell you to."

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:05.620
The town of Harbor has developed into a much
more populated community since the birth of

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.220
the second Look-See in the 30s.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:11.650
Now, the town has attracted a new monster
-- the Santa Claus like demonic creature known

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:15.430
as Walter who eats children who are awake
past midnight on Christmas Eve.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:19.840
In 2012, Walter commits what is assumed to
be the first of a string of child disappearances

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:21.000
on Christmas Eve.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.520
The episode is titled “Walter’s Revenge”
and while it’s unclear what this little

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:28.270
girl actually did to him to warrant revenge,
it must have been pretty bad, because he eats

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.900
her alive.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:44.260
Her sister Delaney is a witness to this midnight
snack, and would spend the next six years

00:08:44.279 --> 00:08:46.300
plotting a revenge of her own.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.399
A revenge… on his revenge...

00:08:49.399 --> 00:08:51.009
Can we call that a re-revenge?

00:08:51.009 --> 00:08:55.139
But before that would happen, there is a week
where three Crypt monster stories all take

00:08:55.139 --> 00:08:57.110
place at once in Harbor.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:01.550
They are: Season 1 of Look-See, Troubled Youth
and Season 2 of Stoneheart.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:06.170
Let’s start with Look-See who rises again
after 13 students at Harbor High are killed

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.250
via poison.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.249
This causes Look-See to come after many parents
and family members mourning the children who

00:09:11.249 --> 00:09:14.259
died, who are unable to release their emotional
ties.

00:09:14.259 --> 00:09:18.129
Look-See forces the assumed killer to do his
bidding by leaving notes for all the other

00:09:18.129 --> 00:09:19.129
victims.

00:09:19.129 --> 00:09:22.379
One of these victims reads her note on the
door of a bathroom stall, because we have

00:09:22.379 --> 00:09:26.759
really terrible public restrooms here in America,
and while she is unable to release her love

00:09:26.759 --> 00:09:30.990
for her separated husband, she is somehow
able to survive the attack, leaving her in

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:33.269
the hospital with two broken legs.

00:09:33.269 --> 00:09:36.700
Look-See appears to her again in the form
of her husband, but this time she’s able

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:41.389
to fight back and drive the creature away,
leaving her physically broken and emotionally

00:09:41.389 --> 00:09:42.389
dead.

00:09:42.389 --> 00:09:46.129
Not long after, Look-See forces her to write
the notes for it’s future victims.

00:09:46.129 --> 00:09:50.899
Meanwhile, at a nearby school called Journey
High, a wolf-like creature runs amok, killing

00:09:50.899 --> 00:09:54.889
several students with the assistance of her
master, a cheerleader named Eva.

00:09:54.889 --> 00:09:58.940
Not long after that, a second incident takes
place at the local library, where it’s revealed

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.649
that this other girl has the ability to transform
into the monster.

00:10:02.649 --> 00:10:06.829
And while all of this is going on, because
this town is REALLY having a bad week, a girl

00:10:06.829 --> 00:10:10.579
named Rebecca inherits the power of the ancient
witch named Aponi.

00:10:10.579 --> 00:10:14.439
The power takes over whenever she’s in the
presence of abusive people, and she uses it

00:10:14.439 --> 00:10:16.220
to kill her alcoholic father.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.769
She starts attending a support group for the
abused.

00:10:18.769 --> 00:10:23.620
As she meets each member, Aponi helps her
take out all the toxic people in their lives.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:27.920
One day, the two goth sisters follow her home
and witness Aponi’s power when Rebecca beats

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.529
up three guys who gang up on her.

00:10:29.529 --> 00:10:33.860
The sisters become obsessed with her powers,
and attempt on two separate occasions to ambush

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.420
Rebecca to try and learn the power’s secret.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.160
Little does she know, the group was just a
facade.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:43.749
The group leader and the goth sisters are
in league with… you guessed it, the Sunny

00:10:43.749 --> 00:10:47.879
Family Cult, in order to try to transfer Rebecca’s
power to one of them.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:53.750
At the end of the season, they appear to have
succeeded in stealing the power of Aponi.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:11:03.199
"The last reported Sunny killing was in 2015
in the Northern Iowa town of Bettendorf."

00:11:03.199 --> 00:11:07.259
This is the last Sunny Family Cult incident
to be reported in the news, but that doesn’t

00:11:07.259 --> 00:11:09.629
mean they aren’t active in 2016.

00:11:09.629 --> 00:11:14.230
Taylor goes on a date with a college boy at
age 16, where they sneak into a swimming pool

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:18.029
and she lures him into a shed where she is
supposed to kill him in front of her parents

00:11:18.029 --> 00:11:21.130
as a cult initiation, but she’s unable to
go through with it.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:25.420
Her father is upset with her, so to make up
for it, she invites 4 friends over, telling

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.380
them her parents aren’t home.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:31.009
The friends come over and play truth or dare,
but hang with me, this is much better than

00:11:31.009 --> 00:11:35.089
that one movie… Taylor is dared to do 7
minutes in heaven with one of the boys, but

00:11:35.089 --> 00:11:38.610
when time runs out, she’s the only one who
comes out alive.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.769
She cuts the power and kills the other girl
they are hanging out with.

00:11:41.769 --> 00:11:43.860
Then she stabs the other girl’s boyfriend.

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:47.560
She tells the last boy she likes him and invites
him to join the cult.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.249
He refuses, so she kills him as well.

00:11:50.249 --> 00:11:52.059
That week is the last week of school.

00:11:52.059 --> 00:11:53.990
Taylor makes a new friend named Jaina.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.759
Taylor starts feeling regretful about what
she’s done, and vents in her diary.

00:11:57.759 --> 00:12:01.800
She finally meets Roger, who is posing as
a substitute teacher at her school in order

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:02.899
to keep an eye on her.

00:12:02.899 --> 00:12:06.100
He would later come after Taylor and Jaina
with an axe while they are sneaking around

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:10.259
the school after hours in order to scare Taylor
into believing her family could be in danger.

00:12:10.259 --> 00:12:14.959
Taylor, Jaina and her boyfriend Lance celebrate
Taylor’s seventeenth birthday as she struggles

00:12:14.959 --> 00:12:17.589
between normalcy and her life in the cult.

00:12:17.589 --> 00:12:21.279
As they are all leaving, Roger kills Jaina’s
boyfriend and leaves the Sunny Family Cult

00:12:21.279 --> 00:12:23.890
calling card along with his body in the woods.

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:28.240
The stage is set for Roger to change his story
on the girls, pretending to be a police officer

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.770
investigating the killer.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:33.240
Taylor connects this to the man who came after
her at the school, thinking that Roger has

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:37.580
a chance to catch this man, but not knowing
that that actually was Roger trying to trick

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:38.580
her.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:41.709
He tells Taylor she might be in danger and
wants to take her in for questioning, but

00:12:41.709 --> 00:12:46.680
instead, kidnaps her and drives her across
the country to a motel in the California desert.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.440
They arrive there on May 21st.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:51.160
Roger kills two tourists and the motel manager.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.639
He introduces Taylor to the Crypt Tome, which
is still in his possession.

00:12:54.639 --> 00:12:59.209
He tells her that he believes she is the girl
of 17 who will give him the power to transform

00:12:59.209 --> 00:13:00.890
as described in the book.

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:04.520
Taylor is able to call her father for help,
but she’s also starting to have some strange

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:05.520
visions.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:09.550
At one point, Taylor has a vision of every
Crypt monster to date; they are all connected

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.999
to this ritual Roger is trying to carry out.

00:13:11.999 --> 00:13:16.240
Her father shows up to save her, but becomes
the fourth blood sacrifice in doing so.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:20.589
In retaliation, Taylor gives Roger what he
wants by killing him, fulfilling the text

00:13:20.589 --> 00:13:25.449
written in the book “the fifth will become
something” and beginning his transformation.

00:13:25.449 --> 00:13:29.880
At some point after this, the Crypt Tome is
given to this mysterious man and taken to

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:30.880
the UK.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:34.809
We’re yet to find out exactly how this happened,
but one can assume that Roger just had no

00:13:34.809 --> 00:13:36.060
more use for the book.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:43.560
There are a few Crypt series that don’t
have exact dates associated with them.

00:13:43.569 --> 00:13:47.250
There’s the Door in the Woods which sees
the unleashing of the monster who murders

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:52.499
the entire town except for one girl, who loses
her arm as she seals the monster once again.

00:13:52.499 --> 00:13:56.619
This appears to take place in the past, but
this may just be a society that has rejected

00:13:56.619 --> 00:14:00.980
technology, because the monster, the Brute,
also appears in Hospice, the story of a haunted

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:04.649
hospital wing, which seems to take place a
couple years before present day.

00:14:04.649 --> 00:14:08.569
The Birch only has a single episode out, but
looks to be more or less modern day, and the

00:14:08.569 --> 00:14:11.499
plot is about the summoning of a forest dwelling
protective creature.

00:14:11.499 --> 00:14:16.221
Soot is a grim-reaper like monster who reclaims
the lives of those who escaped death in a

00:14:16.221 --> 00:14:17.221
modern setting.

00:14:17.221 --> 00:14:21.309
I believe these all take place before the
events of Mohawk, which looks to take place

00:14:21.309 --> 00:14:23.209
around April or May of 2018.

00:14:23.209 --> 00:14:27.429
At the very least, we know that school is
in session, and it’s warm out.

00:14:27.429 --> 00:14:31.550
Remember way back earlier in this video if
you were even paying attention when I mentioned

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.329
the man who was decapitated by the ghost girl
in 2007?

00:14:35.329 --> 00:14:40.059
Well in 2018, a new family moves into that
same house after the father is fired from

00:14:40.059 --> 00:14:43.550
his job in New York after getting too handsy
with his nursing staff.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:47.679
The family struggles to adapt to the small
town, and the son, who is regarded as a freak

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:52.220
by nearly everyone in the story, has these
visions of the ghosts that inhabit the town.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:56.089
The ghosts begin to attack his older sister,
killing her and hanging her up in the front

00:14:56.089 --> 00:14:58.110
yard on their second night in town.

00:14:58.110 --> 00:15:02.589
Upon discovering this, the Dad loses it and
goes after the son, proclaiming that he should

00:15:02.589 --> 00:15:03.589
have been the one to die.

00:15:03.589 --> 00:15:08.240
That’s when the ghost of the girl from 2007
starts messing with the father, before ultimately

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.600
completely tearing him apart with her chains.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:14.839
The mother runs into the street to try to
get help, only to be ignored by everyone in

00:15:14.839 --> 00:15:18.730
town, who are somehow being monitored by these
little packs with red blinking lights.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.520
Before the mother is able to escape the town,
she too is run down by the ghost.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.780
The fate of the son is still unknown.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.520
The modern day events of Shelley can’t take
place long after that, as those take place

00:15:31.529 --> 00:15:35.380
20 years after Shelley’s death, at the Avon
Manor High School Reunion.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:39.329
Shelly comes back to life, and with the assistance
of Celine, exacts her revenge on the three

00:15:39.329 --> 00:15:41.740
high school bullies responsible for her death.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:46.269
She saves Heidi, the girl hired to assassinate
her, for last, and hangs her body before the

00:15:46.269 --> 00:15:47.950
entire school reunion.

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:51.680
Having gotten what she wanted from Celine,
Shelley turns on her, to get revenge for how

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.249
she turned a blind eye to the three bullies
all those years ago.

00:15:55.249 --> 00:15:59.410
Shelly cuts off Celine’s hand and takes
back the bracelet given to her by her boyfriend.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.899
She takes it to the man with the Crypt Tome,
who uses some kind of spell to power it up

00:16:03.899 --> 00:16:04.899
again.

00:16:04.899 --> 00:16:08.230
The school administrators throw their best
man to try and cut down Shelley and prevent

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:12.819
anymore damage, but she defeats him, and she’s
able to successfully resurrect Oliver.

00:16:12.819 --> 00:16:18.040
Together, Shelly and Oliver do away with the
rest of the corrupt administration, thus completing

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.760
their mission… for now.

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:23.500
What Shelley doesn’t realize is that the
strange man with the Crypt Tome pits her and

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.129
Celine against each other.

00:16:25.129 --> 00:16:28.920
Celine comes to Shelley’s family home disguised
as Shelley, who has been dead for over 20

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:32.759
years now, and kills her sister and mother
before setting fire to the house.

00:16:32.759 --> 00:16:36.899
The man who powered up Shelley’s bracelet
is behind it, and he likely wants to fuel

00:16:36.899 --> 00:16:39.720
Shelley’s rage in order to motivate her
to do more of his bidding.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:45.300
Our last story takes us once again, back to
Harbor for Christmas Eve 2018.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:49.550
Six years have passed since Delaney watched
Walter kill her sister, and she’s been plotting

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.980
ever since about how she can exact her re-revenge.

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:56.850
She invites her middle school friends over
and together, they develop a plan to capture

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.899
Walter, using human bait and the holiday decorations
set up around the house.

00:17:00.899 --> 00:17:05.510
They successfully capture Walter, but foolishly
leave him alone to untie himself while waiting

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:08.060
for someone to pick up the body and dispose
of it.

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.980
Come on Delaney, you were this close.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.789
When you’re dealing with Walter you gotta
wish him a Merry Christmas AND a Happy New

00:17:13.789 --> 00:17:14.789
Year.

00:17:14.789 --> 00:17:17.149
Walter gets out and attacks one, if not all
of them.

00:17:17.149 --> 00:17:21.839
At some point he escapes, and goes on to devour
another little girl at another house.

00:17:21.839 --> 00:17:25.650
I think the interesting thing about these
Crypt monsters that sets them apart from one

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.880
another is that each one represents something.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:32.470
Those of you who watched the previous episode
of Horror History probably recognized Mordeo

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:37.429
as Crypt’s interpretation of a Wendigo,
which warns against the taboo of cannibalism.

00:17:37.429 --> 00:17:41.320
Shelley is all about karma, that which you
do to others will come back to you.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.940
Look-See represents lingering feelings and
regrets.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:48.360
Aponi is all about the power to stand up for
oneself against abuse and trauma.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:53.260
And the Sunny Family Cult focuses on themes
of individuality and finding your own path;

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.039
fighting for your own values.

00:17:55.039 --> 00:17:59.140
This does not mark the end of the Crypt monster
universe though, far from it.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:03.529
There are new entries into the Crypt lore
being uploaded Fridays on Crypt TV, and coming

00:18:03.529 --> 00:18:07.920
in May a new series FIGHT NIGHT, where Crypt
monsters will be facing off against humans

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:11.600
in epic cage matches, so make sure you’re
subscribed to their channel as they continue

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:16.570
to fill in some of the missing gaps on this
timeline and I’ll see you in the next one.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.400
Assuming we both survive.

